<title>UK: British Gas firms after broker upgrade.</title>
<headline>British Gas firms after broker upgrade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in British Gas firmed on Thursday after NatWest Securities raised its recommendation to &quot;add&quot; from &quot;hold&quot;, market sources said.</p>
<p>British gas shares edged 1p higher to 193-1/2p in early trading on volume of three million.</p>
<p>NatWest analysts were not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8712</p>
